              "content": "Token system behind the personal workbench of Ihor Mukovoz — the living record of software he builds, problems he investigates, decisions he makes, things he keeps, and work he has shipped. This sheet defines color primitives, semantic roles, typography, spacing, radius and elevation for light and dark.",
